---
/**
 * Gutter layer for decorative stickers. Hidden below 1240px by base.css.
 *
 * Named for what it is rather than for what it holds: `Props` is the name
 * Astro gives a component's own prop interface, and every section that uses
 * this one also has props of its own to declare.
 */
---

<div class="props" aria-hidden="true">
  <slot />
</div>
